# 高频词汇 List09
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2023恋练有词
# 描述: 高频词汇List09核心词汇

{{attach}}{/əˈtætʃ/}{附上；重视}{Please attach your resume to the email.}}
{{attain}}{/əˈteɪn/}{达到；获得}{She attained the highest score in the class.}}
{{attempt}}{/əˈtempt/}{尝试；企图}{He attempted to climb the mountain but failed.}}
{{attribute}}{/əˈtrɪbjuːt/}{归因于；属性}{The success of the project was attributed to teamwork.}}
{{authority}}{/ɔːˈθɒrəti/}{权威；当局}{The health authority issued new guidelines.}}
{{available}}{/əˈveɪləbl/}{可用的；有空的}{The book is available in all major bookstores.}}
{{aware}}{/əˈweər/}{意识到的；知道的}{People are becoming more aware of environmental issues.}}
{{barrier}}{/ˈbæriər/}{障碍；屏障}{Language can be a barrier to communication.}}
{{benefit}}{/ˈbenɪfɪt/}{利益；好处}{Exercise has many health benefits.}}
{{bias}}{/ˈbaɪəs/}{偏见；偏差}{The study was criticized for its cultural bias.}}
{{capable}}{/ˈkeɪpəbl/}{有能力的；能干的}{She is capable of handling any challenge.}}
{{capacity}}{/kəˈpæsəti/}{能力；容量}{The stadium has a capacity of 50,000 spectators.}}
{{capture}}{/ˈkæptʃər/}{捕获；拍摄}{The photographer captured a stunning sunset.}}
{{cease}}{/siːs/}{停止；终止}{The factory ceased production due to lack of demand.}}
{{challenge}}{/ˈtʃælɪndʒ/}{挑战；质疑}{Climate change poses a major challenge to humanity.}}
{{channel}}{/ˈtʃænl/}{频道；渠道}{The company uses social media channels to reach customers.}}
{{chapter}}{/ˈtʃæptər/}{章节；阶段}{Let's move on to the next chapter.}}
{{circumstance}}{/ˈsɜːkəmstəns/}{环境；情况}{Under no circumstances should you leave the building.}}
{{cite}}{/saɪt/}{引用；举例}{The professor cited several studies to support her argument.}}
{{claim}}{/kleɪm/}{声称；索取}{The company claims that its product is the best on the market.}}
{{clarify}}{/ˈklærɪfaɪ/}{澄清；阐明}{Could you clarify what you mean by this statement?}}
{{classic}}{/ˈklæsɪk/}{经典的；典型的}{This novel is a classic of English literature.}}
{{climate}}{/ˈklaɪmət/}{气候；风气}{The political climate has changed dramatically.}}
{{coincide}}{/ˌkəʊɪnˈsaɪd/}{巧合；一致}{The two events coincided by pure chance.}}
{{collapse}}{/kəˈlæps/}{倒塌；崩溃}{The building collapsed during the earthquake.}}
{{combat}}{/ˈkɒmbæt/}{战斗；对抗}{The government is taking steps to combat corruption.}}
{{comment}}{/ˈkɒment/}{评论；意见}{She made a positive comment about the presentation.}}
{{commission}}{/kəˈmɪʃn/}{委员会；佣金}{The commission was established to investigate the matter.}}
{{commit}}{/kəˈmɪt/}{犯（罪）；承诺}{The government committed to reducing carbon emissions.}}
{{communicate}}{/kəˈmjuːnɪkeɪt/}{沟通；传达}{It is important to communicate effectively with your team.}}
